# Grayfall Keep (plan 41 · EG9): the old sea fort where the villain teams' leaders were gathered by a rumour. A quick,
# bright, taunting waltz in D minor (the outline sheet's 16b): a violin's staccato tune over a pizzicato oom-pah-pah and
# a bowed bass, an accordion answering in the second half. Original composition for this game, in the classic sound.
